 id=\"auditContent\" class=\"padded\"></div></section>\r\n      <section id=\"settingsPanel\" class=\"hidden settings-grid\"><article class=\"card padded\"><h2>Configuración de notificaciones</h2><p>Cuenta de envío: <strong>darshanbachhavapp@gmail.com</strong></p><p class=\"muted\">El disparador del propietario procesa la cola aproximadamente cada minuto.</p><form id=\"settingsForm\"><label class=\"check\"><input id=\"emailEnabled\" type=\"checkbox\">Activar envío automático de decisiones</label><label class=\"field\">Dominios institucionales permitidos<input id=\"domains\" placeholder=\"uma.edu.pe, alumnos.uma.edu.pe\"><small>Separados por comas. Vacío permite cualquier dominio válido.</small></label><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Guardar configuración</button></form></article><article class=\"card padded\"><h2>Estado de Google Workspace</h2><div id=\"healthContent\"></div><button id=\"healthRefresh\" class=\"button secondary\">Verificar conexión</button></article></section>\r\n      <footer class=\"page-footer\"><span>Universidad María Auxiliadora · Área de Tesorería</span><span>Gestión de descuentos corporativos</span></footer>\r\n    </main>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<dialog id=\"detailDialog\" class=\"detail-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"detailTitle\"><header class=\"detail-header\"><div><div id=\"detailCode\" class=\"eyebrow\"></div><h2 id=\"detailTitle\">Expediente</h2></div><button id=\"closeDetail\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Cerrar expediente\"><span class=\"ui-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"/></svg></span></button></header><div id=\"detailContent\"></div></dialog>\r\n<dialog id=\"confirmDialog\" class=\"confirm-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"confirmTitle\"><div class=\"padded\"><span class=\"confirm-icon\"><span class=\"ui-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></span></span><h2 id=\"confirmTitle\">Confirmar decisión y notificación</h2><p id=\"confirmText\"></p><div class=\"notice\">El mensaje se enviará al correo registrado por este estudiante. La decisión quedará en el historial.</div><div class=\"dialog-actions\"><button id=\"cancelDecision\" class=\"button secondary\">Volver a revisar</button><button id=\"confirmDecision\" class=\"button primary\">Confirmar y notificar</button></div></div></dialog>\r\n<div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast hidden\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\r\n<?!= include_('Client'); ?>\r\n</body></html>\r\n","Setup":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"es\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Configurar Google Workspace · UMA</title><?!= include_('Styles'); ?><style>body{max-width:1040px;padding:32px;margin:auto}.setup-logo{width:220px;height:auto;margin-bottom:24px}.setup-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.setup-result{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#f3f5f8;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}#setupStatus{font-size:14px;margin:16px 0}</style></head><body><img class=\"setup-logo\" src=\"<?!= include_('Logo'); ?>\" alt=\"Universidad María Auxiliadora\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">CONFIGURACIÓN DEL PROPIETARIO</div><h1>Conectar Google Workspace</h1><p>Esta pantalla solo admite la cuenta darshanbachhavapp@gmail.com. Inicialice los recursos, prepare las cargas de archivos y verifique el sistema antes de abrir solicitudes.</p><section class=\"card padded\"><h2>Recursos y automatizaciones</h2><div class=\"setup-actions\"><button class=\"button primary\" data-action=\"initializeProject\">Crear o recuperar recursos</button><button class=\"button secondary\" data-action=\"runSystemHealthCheck\">Verificar configuración</button><button class=\"button secondary\" data-action=\"finalizeSetup\">Finalizar e instalar disparadores</button><button class=\"button secondary\" data-action=\"publishForms\">Abrir formularios</button></div><p class=\"muted\">La inicialización es repetible. Los formularios permanecen cerrados hasta que configure los archivos y los publique.</p></section><section class=\"card padded\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><h2>Conexión con Render y PDF original</h2><form id=\"setupForm\"><label class=\"field\">Origen público de Render (solo https://dominio, sin ruta)<input id=\"frontendOrigin\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://uma-descuentos-corporativos.onrender.com\" required></label><label class=\"field\">PDF original vacío de la ficha socioeconómica<input id=\"templateFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/pdf\"></label><p class=\"muted\">Puede cargar el PDF original incluido en el proyecto. Se guarda privado, separado de los expedientes. El enlace de descarga para estudiantes apunta al PDF vacío del sitio Render.</p><button class=\"button primary\">Guardar conexión</button></form></section><p id=\"setupStatus\" role=\"status\"></p><div id=\"setupLinks\"></div><pre id=\"setupResult\" class=\"setup-result\">Pendiente de inicialización.</pre><script>\r\nconst result=document.getElementById('setupResult'),status=document.getElementById('setupStatus');\r\nfunction run(name,...args){status.textContent='Procesando en Google…';document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>google.script.run.withSuccessHandler(value=>{result.textContent=JSON.stringify(value,null,2);status.textContent='Operación completada.';document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=false);resolve(value);}).withFailureHandler(error=>{status.textContent=error.message;document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=false);reject(error);})[name](...args));}\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>run(button.dataset.action).catch(()=>{}));\r\ndocument.getElementById('setupForm').onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();const origin=document.getElementById('frontendOrigin').value.replace(/\\/$/,''),file=document.getElementById('templateFile').files[0];let upload=null;if(file){if(file.type!=='application/pdf'||file.size>5*1024*1024){status.textContent='Seleccione un PDF original de hasta 5 MB.';return;}const data=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(reader.result.split(',')[1]);reader.onerror=reject;reader.readAsDataURL(file);});upload={name:file.name,data};}run('configureWorkspace',{origin,template:upload}).catch(()=>{});};\r\n</script></body></html>\r\n","Styles":"<style>\r\n:root{--brand:#e91953;--brand-hover:#c90f42;--ink:#20242d;--muted:#6c7380;--line:#e5e8ed;--bg:#f4f6f8;--green:#18734f;--amber:#94601b;--shadow:0 3px 12px #18223004;font:16px/1.55 \"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);font-synthesis:none}\r\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}button,a{touch-action:manipulation}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}a{color:var(--brand)}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ed5682;outline-offset:4px}.hidden{display:none!important}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}.skip{position:fixed;top:-80px;left:16px;z-index:110;background:white;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px}.skip:focus{top:12px}.ui-icon{display:inline-flex;width:21px;height:21px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;vertical-align:middle}.ui-icon svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\r\nh1,h2,h3,p{overflow-wrap:break-word}h1{font-size:30px;font-weight:730;letter